12. u2-te#-er-[ru-nim?] 
#tr.ts: uterrūnim
#tr.en: they returned.
13. {disz}[e2]-a-na-bi# [...] 
#tr.ts: ea-nabi ...
#tr.en: Ea-nabi ...
14. i-na# _dur10-tab-ba_ [...] 
#tr.ts: ina pāštim ...
#tr.en: by the double ax ...
15. i-na dub*-[la2-mah]
#tr.ts: ina dublamaḫ
#tr.en: in (the temple of) Dublamaḫ
16. ki-a-am iz-[ku-ur] 
#tr.ts: kīam izkur
#tr.en: swore thus
17. um-ma szu#-[u2-ma] 
#tr.ts: umma šûma
#tr.en: he himself:
18. {disz}ur-[{d}nin-gir2-su] 
#tr.ts: ur-ningirsu
