@reverse 
1. ku-nu-uk-ki a-bi-ia# [x?] 
#tr.ts: kunukki abīya ...
#tr.en: the (adoption) contract of my father
2. la-a ih-pu-u2-ma# 
#tr.ts: la iḫpūma
#tr.en: did not invalidate (lit. break)
